{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22296","headline":"洛中偶作 · 白居易","name":"洛中偶作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五年职翰林，四年涖浔阳。\n一年巴郡守，半年南宫郎。\n二年直纶合，三年刺史堂。\n凡此十五载，有诗千余章。\n境兴周万象，土风备四方。\n独无洛中作，能不心悢悢。\n今爲青宫长，始来游此乡。\n裴回伊涧上，睥睨嵩少傍。\n遇物辄一咏，一咏倾一觞。\n笔下成释憾，卷中同补亡。\n往往顾自哂，眼昏须鬓苍。\n不知老将至，犹自放诗狂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}